{
  "id": "pfd___process_flow_diagram",
  "title": "PFD - Process Flow Diagram",
  "description": "The Process Flow Diagram (PFD) is a schematic illustration of a system showing the relations between major components, their operational values across different modes (minimum, normal, maximum), and key system information including flow, temperature, pressure, and fluid composition.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Process Flow Diagram (PFD) Overview\n\nA Process Flow Diagram (PFD) or System Flow Diagram (SFD) is a schematic illustration showing:\n\n### Key Components to Include:\n- Process Piping\n- Major equipment symbols, names and identification numbers\n- Control valves and operational valves\n- Interconnection with other systems\n- Major bypass and recirculation lines\n- System ratings and operational values (minimum, normal, maximum flow, temperature, pressure)\n- Fluid composition\n\n### Components to Exclude:\n- Pipe class\n- Pipe line numbers\n- Minor bypass lines\n- Isolation and shutoff valves\n- Maintenance vents and drains\n- Relief and safety valves\n- Code class information\n- Seismic class information"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "min_flow",
          "label": "Minimum Flow",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "kg/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "normal_flow",
          "label": "Normal Flow",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "kg/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_flow",
          "label": "Maximum Flow",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 150,
          "unit": "kg/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "min_temp",
          "label": "Minimum Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "normal_temp",
          "label": "Normal Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 60,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_temp",
          "label": "Maximum Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 90,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "min_pressure",
          "label": "Minimum Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "bar"
        },
        {
          "id": "normal_pressure",
          "label": "Normal Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5,
          "unit": "bar"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_pressure",
          "label": "Maximum Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "bar"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_range",
          "label": "Flow Range",
          "formula": "inputs.max_flow - inputs.min_flow",
          "unit": "kg/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_range",
          "label": "Temperature Range",
          "formula": "inputs.max_temp - inputs.min_temp",
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_range",
          "label": "Pressure Range",
          "formula": "inputs.max_pressure - inputs.min_pressure",
          "unit": "bar"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Operating Mode",
        "Flow (kg/s)",
        "Temperature (°C)",
        "Pressure (bar)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Minimum",
          "inputs.min_flow",
          "inputs.min_temp",
          "inputs.min_pressure"
        ],
        [
          "Normal",
          "inputs.normal_flow",
          "inputs.normal_temp",
          "inputs.normal_pressure"
        ],
        [
          "Maximum",
          "inputs.max_flow",
          "inputs.max_temp",
          "inputs.max_pressure"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "PFD System Operating Parameters"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Flow (kg/s)",
            "Temperature (°C)",
            "Pressure (bar)"
          ]
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Minimum",
            "Normal",
            "Maximum"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Flow (kg/s)",
            "data": [
              "inputs.min_flow",
              "inputs.normal_flow",
              "inputs.max_flow"
            ],
            "type": "bar"
          },
          {
            "name": "Temperature (°C)",
            "data": [
              "inputs.min_temp",
              "inputs.normal_temp",
              "inputs.max_temp"
            ],
            "type": "line"
          },
          {
            "name": "Pressure (bar)",
            "data": [
              "inputs.min_pressure",
              "inputs.normal_pressure",
              "inputs.max_pressure"
            ],
            "type": "line"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}